{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手吳雨霏（Kary）日前飛往韓國首爾旅遊充電，並於社交網晒出一系列充滿秋意的靚相。</p><p>Kary換上兩套截然不同的秋冬造型，先穿上白色毛絨外套配牛仔褲，在街頭舉起菲林相機單眼甜笑，又在咖啡店托腮賣萌；</p><p>另一套則以型格黑色皮褸襯格仔短裙及棕色長靴，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T13:17:44.052884+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T13:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T13:10:58.343015+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T13:10:58.343015+00:00","content_hash":"58dd7f1972bbb9e4241146e461a6a52fce323eb163323f9a8c2a3a56f510049e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}